         values-night/themes.xml with the same overrides, so a theme
         looks the same in light, dark and system mode; only Emerald
         Dark follows the light/dark palettes. Glass themes use a
         static gradient window background plus translucent surfaces
         (no live blur). -->
    <style name="Theme.PhoneLinkEmeraldDark" parent="Theme.PhoneLink">
        <!-- No overrides: exactly the pre-2.25 look. -->
    </style>
